//: SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorAcceptedSummary: stage0 が evidence table owner を閉じた後に保持する代表結果
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - accepted path と missing path の観測値を owner なしで保持します。
//: - `copy_status` と `drop_status` は、table に record が無い operation を Missing へ畳む既存 evidence table API 経由の結果です。
pub struct SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorAcceptedSummary:
    table_len %i32
    copy_status %Result SelfhostMemoTraitAggregateProofStatus SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceErrorKind
    drop_status %Result SelfhostMemoTraitAggregateProofStatus SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceErrorKind

//: SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind: connector 境界の失敗分類
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - public surface state 検査、evidence table owner 生成、operation impl lookup、evidence push、solver wrapper のどこで失敗したかを typed enum として保持します。
pub enum SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind:
    PublicSurfaceHashMissing
    EvidenceTableAllocFailed %StdErrorKind
    OperationImplRejected %SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTableErrorKind
    EvidenceTablePushRejected %SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceErrorKind
    OperationSolverRejected %SelfhostMemoTraitOperationSolverErrorKind

//: SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorStage0Summary: connector smoke の代表結果
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - accepted Copy evidence、別 TypeId の Missing fold、duplicate rejection、surface hash 0 rejection を public API 経由で確認します。
pub struct SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorStage0Summary:
    accepted %Result SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorAcceptedSummary SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind
    missing %Result SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorAcceptedSummary SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind
    duplicate_rejected %Result SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorAcceptedSummary SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind
    zero_hash_rejected %Result SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorAcceptedSummary SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind

//: Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorAcceptedSummary: owner を含まない summary を borrow から値へ戻す
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - summary は evidence table owner を持ちません。owner cleanup は summary 作成前に完了しています。
impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorAcceptedSummary:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorAcceptedSummary SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorAcceptedSummary \self:
        *self

//: Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorAcceptedSummary: stage0 summary payload を copyable として扱う
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - `copy_status` と `drop_status` は typed enum payload であり、resource owner を保持しません。
impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorAcceptedSummary:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorAcceptedSummary SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorAcceptedSummary \self:
        self

//: Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind: typed error payload を borrow から値へ戻す
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - nested error を表示文字列へ潰さず、lower boundary の enum payload のまま保持します。
impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind \self:
        *self

//: Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind: owner を含まない error payload を copyable として扱う
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - error enum は table owner や evidence table owner を含みません。copy による二重解放は発生しません。
impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind \self:
        self

//: Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorStage0Summary: stage0 summary を borrow から値へ戻す
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - summary は owner cleanup 済みの代表値だけを保持します。
impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorStage0Summary:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorStage0Summary SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorStage0Summary \self:
        *self

//: Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorStage0Summary: stage0 summary を copyable として扱う
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - accepted / missing / rejection payload は typed enum と scalar だけです。
impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorStage0Summary:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorStage0Summary SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorStage0Summary \self:
        self

//: selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_evidence_connector_summary_new: accepted summary を[作/つく]る
fn selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_evidence_connector_summary_new %fn i32 fn Result SelfhostMemoTraitAggregateProofStatus SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceErrorKind fn Result SelfhostMemoTraitAggregateProofStatus SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorAcceptedSummary \table_len\copy_status\drop_status:
    SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorAcceptedSummary table_len copy_status drop_status

//: selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_evidence_connector_stage0_summary_new: stage0 summary を[作/つく]る
fn selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_evidence_connector_stage0_summary_new %fn Result SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorAcceptedSummary SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind fn Result SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorAcceptedSummary SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind fn Result SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorAcceptedSummary SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind fn Result SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorAcceptedSummary SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorStage0Summary \accepted\missing\duplicate_rejected\zero_hash_rejected:
    SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorStage0Summary accepted missing duplicate_rejected zero_hash_rejected

//: selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_evidence_connector_operation_error_result: impl table error を connector error へ[写/うつ]す
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - `CandidateMissing` は error にしません。この helper は Missing 以外の impl table error を、evidence table owner cleanup 後に返すためだけに使います。
fn selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_evidence_connector_operation_error_result %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTableErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind \error:
    match error:
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTableErrorKind::CandidateMissing:
            SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind::OperationImplRejected SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTableErrorKind::CandidateMissing
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTableErrorKind::CandidateDuplicate:
            SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind::OperationImplRejected SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTableErrorKind::CandidateDuplicate
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTableErrorKind::CandidateReadFailed idx:
            SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind::OperationImplRejected SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTableErrorKind::CandidateReadFailed idx
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTableErrorKind::CandidatePushFailed push_error:
            SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind::OperationImplRejected SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTableErrorKind::CandidatePushFailed push_error
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTableErrorKind::ClassifierRejected classifier_error:
            SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind::OperationImplRejected SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTableErrorKind::ClassifierRejected classifier_error
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTableErrorKind::ProducerRejected producer_error:
            SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind::OperationImplRejected SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTableErrorKind::ProducerRejected producer_error

//: selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_evidence_connector_push_operation_result: 1 operation の impl evidence を table へ[追加/ついか]する
//:
//: [戻/もど]り[値/ち]:
//: - `Ok(table)`: record を追加したか、CandidateMissing のため何も追加せず同じ table owner を返しました。
//: - `Err(OperationImplRejected(_))`: Missing 以外の impl table error です。この関数は返る前に evidence table owner を閉じます。
//: - `Err(EvidenceTablePushRejected(_))`: push が table owner を消費して失敗しました。push boundary が owner vec を閉じるため、この関数では追加の free を行いません。
fn selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_evidence_connector_push_operation_result %impure fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceTable impure fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTable impure fn SelfhostTypeId impure fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceTable SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind \table\impls\type_id\operation:
    match selfhost_memo_trait_operation_impl_record_for_type_operation_result impls type_id operation:
        Result::Ok record:
            match selfhost_memo_trait_operation_evidence_table_push table record:
                Result::Ok next_table:
                    Result::Ok next_table
                Result::Err push_error:
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind::EvidenceTablePushRejected push_error
        Result::Err impl_error:
            match impl_error:
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTableErrorKind::CandidateMissing:
                    Result::Ok table
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTableErrorKind::CandidateDuplicate:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_evidence_table_free table
                    Result::Err selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_evidence_connector_operation_error_result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTableErrorKind::CandidateDuplicate
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTableErrorKind::CandidateReadFailed idx:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_evidence_table_free table
                    Result::Err selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_evidence_connector_operation_error_result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTableErrorKind::CandidateReadFailed idx
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTableErrorKind::CandidatePushFailed push_error:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_evidence_table_free table
                    Result::Err selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_evidence_connector_operation_error_result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTableErrorKind::CandidatePushFailed push_error
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTableErrorKind::ClassifierRejected classifier_error:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_evidence_table_free table
                    Result::Err selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_evidence_connector_operation_error_result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTableErrorKind::ClassifierRejected classifier_error
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTableErrorKind::ProducerRejected producer_error:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_evidence_table_free table
                    Result::Err selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_evidence_connector_operation_error_result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTableErrorKind::ProducerRejected producer_error

//: selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_evidence_table_for_type_from_impl_table_result: impl table から root operation evidence table を[作/つく]る
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - public impl materializer が作った candidate table を、ty 層の operation evidence table owner に変換します。
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - Copy、Drop、Eq、Hash の順で処理します。この順序は出力 table の deterministic order のためであり、proof semantics は enum key と TypeId で決まります。
//: - Missing candidate は table に push せず、後段の evidence table lookup が Missing status へ畳みます。
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_evidence_table_for_type_from_impl_table_result %impure fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTable impure fn SelfhostTypeId Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceTable SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind \impls\type_id:
    match selfhost_memo_trait_operation_evidence_table_new:
        Result::Ok table0:
            match selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_evidence_connector_push_operation_result table0 impls type_id SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind::Copy:
                Result::Ok table1:
                    match selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_evidence_connector_push_operation_result table1 impls type_id SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind::Drop:
                        Result::Ok table2:
                            match selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_evidence_connector_push_operation_result table2 impls type_id SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind::Eq:
                                Result::Ok table3:
                                    selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_evidence_connector_push_operation_result table3 impls type_id SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind::Hash
                                Result::Err e:
                                    Result::Err e
                        Result::Err e:
                            Result::Err e
                Result::Err e:
                    Result::Err e
        Result::Err alloc_error:
            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind::EvidenceTableAllocFailed alloc_error

//: selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_evidence_table_for_type_from_surface_state_result: surface state から root operation evidence table を[作/つく]る
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - state は borrow です。この関数は state owner を閉じません。
//: - hash 0 の state は orchestrator 由来の complete transport として信用せず、operation impl table を読みません。
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_evidence_table_for_type_from_surface_state_result %impure fn &SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplSurfaceState impure fn SelfhostTypeId Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceTable SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind \state\type_id:
    if:
        eq selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_surface_state_public_surface_hash state 0
        then:
            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind::PublicSurfaceHashMissing
        else:
            let impls %&SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTable field::get_ref state "operation_impls"
            selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_evidence_table_for_type_from_impl_table_result impls type_id

//: selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_proof_table_for_type_from_impl_table_result: impl table evidence を既存 solver へ[渡/わた]す
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - caller が `SelfhostMemoTraitOperationProofTable` owner を必要とする場合に、operation evidence table の一時 owner をこの関数内で閉じます。
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - aggregate field traversal と root evidence merge は `selfhost_memo_trait_operation_solver_table_for_type_with_operation_evidence_result` に委譲します。
//: - solver が失敗した場合も一時 evidence table owner は必ず閉じます。
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_proof_table_for_type_from_impl_table_result %impure fn &SelfhostTypeArena impure fn &SelfhostMemoTraitLayoutEvidenceTable impure fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTable impure fn SelfhostTypeId impure fn i32 Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationProofTable SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind \types\layout_table\impls\type_id\max_depth:
    match selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_evidence_table_for_type_from_impl_table_result impls type_id:
        Result::Ok evidence_table:
            let solver_result %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationProofTable SelfhostMemoTraitOperationSolverErrorKind selfhost_memo_trait_operation_solver_table_for_type_with_operation_evidence_result types layout_table &evidence_table type_id max_depth
            selfhost_memo_trait_operation_evidence_table_free evidence_table
            match solver_result:
                Result::Ok proof_table:
                    Result::Ok proof_table
                Result::Err solver_error:
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind::OperationSolverRejected solver_error
        Result::Err e:
            Result::Err e

//: selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_proof_table_for_type_from_surface_state_result: surface state evidence を既存 solver へ[渡/わた]す
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - state は borrow です。この関数は state owner を閉じません。
//: - hash 0 rejection と evidence table cleanup は lower helper と同じ規則に従います。
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_proof_table_for_type_from_surface_state_result %impure fn &SelfhostTypeArena impure fn &SelfhostMemoTraitLayoutEvidenceTable impure fn &SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplSurfaceState impure fn SelfhostTypeId impure fn i32 Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationProofTable SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind \types\layout_table\state\type_id\max_depth:
    match selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_evidence_table_for_type_from_surface_state_result state type_id:
        Result::Ok evidence_table:
            let solver_result %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationProofTable SelfhostMemoTraitOperationSolverErrorKind selfhost_memo_trait_operation_solver_table_for_type_with_operation_evidence_result types layout_table &evidence_table type_id max_depth
            selfhost_memo_trait_operation_evidence_table_free evidence_table
            match solver_result:
                Result::Ok proof_table:
                    Result::Ok proof_table
                Result::Err solver_error:
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind::OperationSolverRejected solver_error
        Result::Err e:
            Result::Err e

//: selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_evidence_connector_error_kind_eq: connector error が同じ分類か[返/かえ]す
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - nested error payload まで比較します。
//: - wildcard arm は使いません。variant が増えた場合はこの equality 境界を明示的に更新します。
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_evidence_connector_error_kind_eq %fn SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind fn SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind bool \a\b:
    match a:
        SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind::PublicSurfaceHashMissing:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind::PublicSurfaceHashMissing:
                    true
                SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind::EvidenceTableAllocFailed _b_alloc:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind::OperationImplRejected _b_impl:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind::EvidenceTablePushRejected _b_push:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind::OperationSolverRejected _b_solver:
                    false
        SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind::EvidenceTableAllocFailed a_alloc:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind::PublicSurfaceHashMissing:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind::EvidenceTableAllocFailed b_alloc:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_operation_evidence_connector_std_error_kind_eq a_alloc b_alloc
                SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind::OperationImplRejected _b_impl:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind::EvidenceTablePushRejected _b_push:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind::OperationSolverRejected _b_solver:
                    false
        SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind::OperationImplRejected a_impl:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind::PublicSurfaceHashMissing:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind::EvidenceTableAllocFailed _b_alloc:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind::OperationImplRejected b_impl:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_impl_table_error_kind_eq a_impl b_impl
                SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplOperationEvidenceConnectorErrorKind::EvidenceTablePushRejected _b_push:
                    false
